ain","type":"activity","detail":"The riverside line from Porto to Pinhao is a ride in itself; a steam-hauled historical train runs Regua to Tua in season.","season":[6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":8,"of":13,"urls":["https://twofindaway.com/things-to-do-in-douro-valley/","https://portoalities.com/en/best-things-to-do-douro-valley/","https://www.winalist.com/blog/portugal-wine-region/douro-valley/what-to-do-douro-valley","https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/what-to-do-in-douro-valley-portugal","https://www.earthtrekkers.com/douro-valley/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Climb Lamego's pilgrimage staircase","type":"experience","detail":"686 azulejo-lined steps rise to the Sanctuary of Our Lady of Remedies above Lamego's old town and Gothic cathedral.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/what-to-do-in-douro-valley-portugal","https://twofindaway.com/things-to-do-in-douro-valley/","https://www.earthtrekkers.com/douro-valley/","https://portoalities.com/en/best-things-to-do-douro-valley/","https://www.winalist.com/blog/portugal-wine-region/douro-valley/what-to-do-douro-valley"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Miradouro hop above the river","type":"experience","detail":"Sao Leonardo de Galafura and Casal de Loivos give the classic terrace-bend panoramas; the N222 links more viewpoints.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.earthtrekkers.com/douro-valley/","https://twofindaway.com/things-to-do-in-douro-valley/","https://portoalities.com/en/best-things-to-do-douro-valley/","https://www.winalist.com/blog/portugal-wine-region/douro-valley/what-to-do-douro-valley"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Join the vindima harvest","type":"festival","detail":"In September estates open harvest programmes: pick grapes with the crews and stomp them by foot in stone lagares.","season":[9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":13,"urls":["https://twofindaway.com/things-to-